 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Desugemu ni Makikomareta Yamamoto-san, Kimama ni Gemu Baransu wo Hokai Saseru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "デスゲームに巻き込まれた山本さん、気ままにゲームバランスを崩壊させる"
   },
   {
    "en": "Yamamoto-san Gets Caught Up in a Death Game and Destroys the Game Balance"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"...Is this a death game?\" The full-dive RPG \"Life is Adventure\" has 100,000 players due to the failure of management, and it has turned into a death game that is going out of control. Yamamoto Rinka, a beautiful player in her thirties, curses her fate and falls into despair -- or did she? \"It's a forced long vacation! If I'm going to do it, I might as well take my time and enjoy the game!\" Moreover, due to a cheat skill that was activated despite her own will, she suddenly became an all-round player...",
   "ja": "「……これ、デスゲーム成立するの？」\n運営の暴走により、10万人規模のデスゲームと化したフルダイブRPG『Life is Adventure』。\nアラサー美少女プレイヤー・山本凛花は運命を呪い、絶望――してなかった!?\n「強制的な長期休暇！ せっかくならクリアは焦らず楽しみたいよね！」\nしかも、本人の意向を無視して発動するチートスキルのせいで、いきなり万能プレイヤーとなってしまい…。\nデスゲーム世界でも、たくましくエンジョイ＆無自覚に無双する山本さんのお話、ゲームスタート！"
  },
